# Input
```astro
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->
<div><li /></div>
<ul><><div><li>Indirect child</li></div></></ul>
<div><><li>Nested fragment item</li><li /></></div>
<div><slot><li>Slot fallback item</li></slot></div>

```

# Diagnostics
```
invalid.astro:2:6 lint/nursery/noMisplacedListElements ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × This <li> element is outside a list container.
  
    1 │ <!-- should generate diagnostics -->
  > 2 │ <div><li /></div>
      │      ^^^^^^
    3 │ <ul><><div><li>Indirect child</li></div></></ul>
    4 │ <div><><li>Nested fragment item</li><li /></></div>
  
  i List items need a list container to form a valid HTML list.
  
  i Make this element a direct child of <ul>, <ol>, or <menu>.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

```

